    "encoding_note": "FC-1 uses 8b/10b at 1/2/4/8 GFC (running disparity, DC balance for clock recovery) and 64b/66b at 16 GFC and above (2-bit sync header + scrambling for low overhead). Ordered sets are 4-byte K28.5-based transmission words. Frame integrity is a 32-bit CRC over the FC-2 header + data field."
